      "_note": "Unlike AWS (which has no distinct producer-side resource -- see aws NOTES.md), GCP's ServiceAttachment IS a first-class producer-side resource with its own self_link, so this is a direct, lossless mapping rather than a synthesis (contrast with endpoint.gcp-psc-to-partner-api.json's consumer-side ForwardingRule-based synthesis). subnet_urn is null: a ServiceAttachment references a NAT subnet pool (nat_subnet_self_links), not a single subnet a single consumer-facing IP lives in -- that's a materially different relationship than NetworkInterface.subnet_urn/PscEndpoint's own subnetwork_self_link, so it is preserved only in extensions.gcp.nat_subnet_self_links rather than forced into subnet_urn. target_service points at the same forwarding rule as load-balancer.gcp-prod-app-ilb.json -- this service attachment publishes that internal load balancer to the explicitly accept-listed consumer project acme-partner-services-654321."
